## chart main DogSwipe Delivery Stack
```mermaid
flowchart LR
  user["iOS user"]
  ios["SwiftUI app"]
  authclient["SPAPSAuthClient"]
  pubkey["SPAPS publishable key"]
  keychain["Keychain access token"]
  refresh["Keychain refresh token"]
  vm["View models"]
  core["DogSwipeCore package"]
  client["DogSwipeAPIClient"]
  profiles["HotdogProfile contract"]
  preferences["CravingPreferences contract"]
  vendor["VendorSubmission contract"]
  menu["MenuSnapshot contract"]
  admin["AdminReview contract"]
  api["FastAPI backend"]
  principal["Principal resolver"]
  migrations["Alembic migrations"]
  deploy["Deploy contract"]
  db["PostgreSQL"]
  spaps["SPAPS auth"]
  gates["Quality Gates"]

  user --> ios
  ios --> authclient
  pubkey --> authclient
  authclient --> spaps
  ios --> keychain
  ios --> refresh
  ios --> vm
  vm --> core
  vm --> client
  core --> profiles
  core --> preferences
  core --> vendor
  core --> menu
  core --> admin
  client --> api
  keychain --> client
  api --> profiles
  api --> preferences
  api --> vendor
  api --> menu
  api --> admin
  api --> principal
  principal --> spaps
  api --> db
  migrations --> db
  deploy --> api
  deploy --> db
  core --> gates
  api --> gates
  migrations --> gates
  deploy --> gates

  gates["Quality Gates"]
  spaps["SPAPS Boundary"]
```

## chart quality Quality Gates
```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> SwiftTests
  SwiftTests --> BackendCoverage
  BackendCoverage --> DeployPreflight
  DeployPreflight --> DriftScan
  DriftScan --> CrapScore
  CrapScore --> [*]
```

## chart spaps SPAPS Boundary
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant App as iOS App
  participant API as DogSwipe API
  participant Menu as Menu URL
  participant SPAPS as Sweet Potato/SPAPS
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  App->>SPAPS: X-API-Key spaps_pub... request magic link
  SPAPS-->>App: Magic-link email token
  App->>SPAPS: Verify magic-link token
  SPAPS-->>App: Access and refresh JWTs
  App->>API: Keychain-backed Authorization: Bearer access JWT
  API->>SPAPS: Validate user/session
  SPAPS-->>API: AuthenticatedUser.user_id
  App->>API: Discovery request with optional current coordinates
  API->>DB: Read preferences and coordinate-backed hotdog profiles
  API-->>App: Preference-filtered discovery with resolved distance
  API->>DB: Read swipes, matches, or preferences
  API-->>App: Match or preference response
  App->>API: Submit vendor hotdog listing
  API->>DB: Store pending_review listing, coordinates, and owner user_id
  API-->>App: Vendor submission response
  App->>API: Refresh owned submission menu
  API->>DB: Load owner-scoped listing and menu_url
  API->>Menu: Fetch bounded HTML/text snapshot
  Menu-->>API: Menu text or fetch error
  API->>DB: Store menu_status, menu_excerpt, and menu_checked_at
  API-->>App: Menu ingestion response
  App->>API: Admin approve / reject / request edits
  API->>DB: Store review status, note, and timestamps
  API-->>App: Moderated hotdog profile
  App->>API: Vendor revises change-requested listing
  API->>DB: Return listing to pending_review
  API-->>App: Resubmitted vendor profile
```
